This repository provides the RTBus RTDuo Arduino platform and the thin Zephyr
runtime application used to run RTBus native application images.

The public Arduino package identity is:

    rtbus:rtduo

RTDuo is the Arduino-compatible application profile for RTBus. Runtime ABI
symbols, enum names, and native API macros use RTBus naming.

